bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Chapter / Reading Page (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control ChapterController
control ChapterService
entity ":ProgressModel" as ProgressModel
entity ":HistoryModel" as HistoryModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Finish / read chapter
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /history/{userId}/{storyId}
activate Router

Router -> ChapterController: 3. createStoryHistory()
activate ChapterController

ChapterController -> ChapterController: 4. Parse params & convert ObjectId
activate ChapterController
space
deactivate ChapterController

ChapterController -> ChapterService: 5. createStoryHistory(user_id, story_id)
activate ChapterService

ChapterService -> ProgressModel: 6. Find latest progress by user
activate ProgressModel

ProgressModel -> MongoDB: 7. findOne({user_id}) sort last_read_at desc
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ProgressModel: 8. Latest progress / null
deactivate MongoDB

ProgressModel --> ChapterService: 9. latestProgress
deactivate ProgressModel

ChapterService -> ChapterService: 10. Check progress
activate ChapterService
space
deactivate ChapterService

opt No progress found
    ChapterService --> ChapterController: 10.1. Return message: No progress found
    ChapterController --> Router: 10.2. HTTP response
    Router --> UI: 10.3. Update UI
    UI --> User: 10.4. No progress found
end

ChapterService -> HistoryModel: 11. Upsert history with last_read_chapter
activate HistoryModel
HistoryModel -> MongoDB: 12. findOneAndUpdate (upsert)
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> HistoryModel: 13. Updated history
deactivate MongoDB
HistoryModel --> ChapterService: 14. History result
deactivate HistoryModel

ChapterService --> ChapterController: 15. Return history
deactivate ChapterService

ChapterController --> Router: 16. HTTP response
deactivate ChapterController

Router --> UI: 17. Update UI
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 18. History saved
deactivate UI
deactivate User